  <name>KTodo</name>
  <summary>Manage your Todoist tasks natively on Plasma</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      KTodo is a Todoist client built with Kirigami and Qt Quick, so it looks
      and behaves like the rest of your Plasma desktop rather than a packaged
      web page.
    </p>
    <p>
      Everything is cached locally and edits are queued, so the app stays
      usable with no connection and replays your changes when you reconnect.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Works offline, with changes queued until you reconnect</li>
      <li>Projects, sub-projects, sections and sub-tasks</li>
      <li>Today and Upcoming views, saved filters and labels</li>
      <li>Team projects with assignees and comment threads</li>
      <li>Due dates, recurring schedules, deadlines and priorities</li>
      <li>Drag and drop to reorder tasks and move them between sections</li>
      <li>Desktop notifications for reminders</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      KTodo is an unofficial client. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
      supported by Doist, the makers of Todoist. A Todoist account is required.
    </p>
  </description>

